@startuml
title Current system - typical workflow
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Open the application;
if (Read public information?) then (yes)
  :View seasons, configuration,\nteams, rosters, or games;
  :Display API data;
else (administer)
  :Sign in as an Administrator;
  :Create season in Planning;
  :Create or choose sports and divisions;
  :Assign sports and divisions to season;
  :Move season to Registration;
  :Create player profiles and register teams;
  :Assign players to team rosters;
  while (An active team is below its roster minimum?) is (yes)
    :Complete the affected rosters;
  endwhile (no)
  :Request transition to Ongoing;
  if (Transition allowed?) then (yes)
    :Schedule and reschedule games;
    :Complete, then archive the season;
  else (no)
    :Return an error;
  endif
endif
stop
legend bottom
  This is a typical workflow, not an enforced sequence.
  The Ongoing check does not require at least one team.
endlegend
@enduml
